The fix: Solidity 0.6.12 does not expose `address.code`, which only exists from Solidity 0.8.0 onward. I added a `_getCode(address)` helper that reads the runtime bytecode using inline assembly (`extcodesize` + `extcodecopy`), and replaced `address(mockRouter).code` with `_getCode(address(mockRouter))` in `setUp`. Everything else (mock router, snapshot/delta structs, and the before/after differential validation with a single final verdict line) is preserved.

